    "text": "BY VIRTUE of the powers vested in me by Section 22 read with Section 26 of the Finance Act, No. 11 of 2004, I, MangalaSamaraweera, the Minister of Finance, do by this Order amend the Schedule I of the International TelecommunicationsOperators Levy (Imposition) Regulations No. 1 of 2010, published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1662/1 dated July12, 2010 as last amended by the Order published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1945/2 dated December 14, 2015, byrepeal of Tables A, A(i), B, C and D and the substitution therefor of the Tables A, A(i), B, C and D of the Schedule hereto.",
